#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/traffic/overview.js
msgid "Traffic"
msgstr "流量统计"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/traffic/overview.js
msgid "Per-application traffic, measured on this router: byte counters from conntrack joined with the domain names AdGuard Home resolved. Traffic that the proxy carries is listed separately, so it is not counted twice."
msgstr "按应用统计的流量，全部在本机测量：conntrack 的字节计数与 AdGuard Home 解析出的域名关联。代理隧道承载的流量单独列出，不会重复计入。"

